# Source data and intermediates: 27 GB of laser tiles, 1.4 GB of rasters. All of
# it is re-derivable from the download_*.py scripts, and none of it is needed to
# view the result -- viewer/data holds the baked output, which IS committed.
# Root-anchored: an unanchored `data/` also matches viewer/data/, which is the
# baked output the hosted page needs and must be committed.
/data/
# Build products and verification output. The screenshots under out/shots are
# debug artefacts from the headless checks -- 42 MB of them reached the first
# published commit because this only excluded _serve and *.ply.
/out/
venv3.13/
de421.bsp
__pycache__/
.mypy_cache/
*.pyc
